flowchart TD
  accTitle: Android launcher icon rendering after PR 148
  accDescr: PR 148 puts the complete iOS icon composition inside Android's centered 66dp adaptive-icon safe zone with a 19.4444 percent inset on each edge. Legacy and Play listing assets use the full composition, and validation checks the foreground contract.

  source[iOS icon composition] --> adaptive[Adaptive foreground: 19.4444% inset on each edge]
  adaptive --> safe[Centered 66dp safe zone in 108dp layer]
  safe --> launcher[Launcher masks retain the complete composition]
  source --> legacy[Legacy icons: full-composition resizes]
  legacy --> sizes[48, 72, 96, 144, and 192px]
  source --> listing[Play listing icon: 512px full composition]
  adaptive --> validation[Brand validation]
  validation --> checks[Four insets and @drawable/brand_icon required]
